WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.564
AI just designed

00:00:01.388 --> 00:00:02.614
an entire CPU

00:00:02.425 --> 00:00:03.298
by itself

00:00:03.822 --> 00:00:05.319
Architect Labs calls

00:00:05.131 --> 00:00:06.027
it Frostbite

00:00:06.216 --> 00:00:07.913
a general-purpose processor

00:00:07.749 --> 00:00:08.692
with a brand-new

00:00:08.504 --> 00:00:09.541
instruction set

00:00:09.588 --> 00:00:10.461
discovered

00:00:10.544 --> 00:00:11.994
designed and verified

00:00:11.853 --> 00:00:12.701
end to end

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:13.373
by their AI

00:00:13.185 --> 00:00:14.022
systems

00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:16.263
Across 25 workloads

00:00:16.429 --> 00:00:17.254
15 of them

00:00:17.066 --> 00:00:18.091
held back until

00:00:17.903 --> 00:00:18.917
the final test

00:00:19.106 --> 00:00:20.909
it delivered 4.59

00:00:20.721 --> 00:00:21.900
times the performance

00:00:21.724 --> 00:00:22.301
per watt of

00:00:22.113 --> 00:00:22.914
a modern

00:00:23.021 --> 00:00:24.424
silicon-proven CPU

00:00:24.235 --> 00:00:24.801
core

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:26.253
A swarm of

00:00:26.101 --> 00:00:27.492
agents tried 58

00:00:27.303 --> 00:00:28.635
design ideas and

00:00:28.447 --> 00:00:29.650
kept 37

00:00:29.898 --> 00:00:30.687
using a chip

00:00:30.499 --> 00:00:31.867
simulator that runs

00:00:31.678 --> 00:00:33.895
660 times faster

00:00:33.707 --> 00:00:34.496
than the real

00:00:34.308 --> 00:00:35.334
hardware model

00:00:35.862 --> 00:00:36.876
Full story on

00:00:36.687 --> 00:00:37.583
the dashboard
